<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 714 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 714 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 714 million pesos in the secondary market on Friday through one credit auction, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auction was offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT	   TERM</p>
<p>    714 million    3 days</p>
<p>*Amount in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
